# Never deploy these to the public web.
# Patterns follow .gitignore rules, which means an unanchored name matches a
# directory at ANY depth. Anchor everything with a leading slash. Without it,
# "supabase/" also matched assets/vendor/supabase/ and took the portal's
# JavaScript library off the deployment, which broke every dealer login.
#
# /docs/ holds the Supabase schema and the DEALER NET price list seed.
/docs/
/README.md
# /supabase/ holds the edge function source. It runs on Supabase, not here.
/supabase/
